"title": "Whale shark observation 85758856","date": "2020-03-10","creator": "Damian Almua","description": "It Was Boat Diving, during the morning. in High Tide. The place is a Rock Formation in the middle of the sea. When we approach the dive site, Whale Shark Appears and was with us the hole diving. He was there during 3 following days.","subject": "Whale shark (Rhincodon typus)", 
