"title": "Seasonal aggregation of juvenile whale sharks (Rhincodon typus) at Christmas Island, Indian Ocean","date": "2009","creator": "Hobbs, JPA; Frisch, AJ; Hamanaka, T; McDonald, CA; Gilligan, JJ; Neilson, J","subject": "Marine & Freshwater Biology", 
